        "original_id": "3d7f55be-41a4-58e3-b16b-e5d6d2c1d033",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tamera Mowry, Tia Mowry\n- Roles: Tamera Campbell, Dr. Kayla Thornton\n- Products: Sister, Sister, Twitches, Twitches Too, Strong Medicine, Twitches book series\n- Companies: ABC, WB, Disney Channel, Scholastic Press\n\nFacts:\n- Tamera Mowry first gained fame for playing Tamera Campbell on the ABC/WB sitcom \"Sister, Sister\" opposite her identical twin sister Tia Mowry.\n- In 2005, \"Twitches\" was released as a Disney Channel Original Movie based on the \"Twitches\" book series published by Scholastic Press.\n- Tamera Mowry starred in the Disney Channel Original Movie \"Twitches\" and its sequel \"Twitches Too\".\n- Tamera Mowry also played Dr. Kayla Thornton on the medical drama \"Strong Medicine\".",
